@startuml
title Activity - Complaint handling end to end (swimlanes)
|Student|
start
:Sign in with GIKI email;
:Fill title, description, location;
:Submit complaint;
|System|
if (Fields valid and within limits?) then (no)
  |Student|
  :See validation error;
  stop
else (yes)
  |System|
  :Suggest category, priority, department
  (keyword triage rules);
  :Save complaint as **Open**;
  :Log TicketCreated; notify hostel supervisor;
endif
repeat
  |Hostel Supervisor|
  :Open complaint from hostel queue;
  :Review triage;
  if (Suggestion correct?) then (yes)
    :Keep suggested values;
  else (no)
    :Override category / priority / department;
  endif
  |System|
  :Status = **UnderReview**; log review; notify student;
  |Hostel Supervisor|
  :Forward to Maintenance Office;
  |System|
  :Status = **Forwarded**; notify Maintenance + student;
  |Maintenance Office|
  :Start work (optional note);
  |System|
  :Status = **InProgress**; notify student;
  |Maintenance Office|
  :Fix the problem;
  :Resolve with resolution note;
  |System|
  :Status = **Resolved**; ask student to confirm;
  |Student|
  if (Problem fixed?) then (yes)
    :Confirm resolution;
    |System|
    :Status = **Closed**; notify supervisor + Maintenance;
    |Student|
    if (Problem returns later?) then (yes)
      :Reopen with reason;
      |System|
      :Status = **Reopened**; notify supervisor + Maintenance;
    else (no)
      stop
    endif
  else (no)
    :Reopen with reason;
    |System|
    :Status = **Reopened**; notify supervisor + Maintenance;
  endif
repeat while (Reopened: back to supervisor review)
@enduml
